    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/1308bfe89b2bed82e5797b1451f6d0c0.avif?t=1742917644\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span><br><br>Welcome to Arcanamals, a turn-based RPG inspired by classic games like the Legend of Zelda and Breath of Fire. The world is on the brink of destruction. With each nation at war, General Mast, with the help of his shadow army, is taking over the realm of Lanthos.<br><br>Play as Max, Tess, and a cast of over ten characters in this apocalyptic world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/aca426518d81719b1efcae1f76c6bd62.poster.avif?t=1742917644\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/aca426518d81719b1efcae1f76c6bd62.apng?t=1742917644\" class=\"bb_img\" width=65 height=65 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/7ee46d64392a446b5cb75a0605a536e1.poster.avif?t=1742917644\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/7ee46d64392a446b5cb75a0605a536e1.apng?t=1742917644\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span><br><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br>Explore two parallel worlds: one human and one arcanamal.<br><br>Level up in many ways: Gain experience through turn based combat, exploration, quests and much more!<br><br>Unique Abilities: Each arcanamal has unique abilities, such as Phroak with his tongue lash, to solve puzzles!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/c7ce5647c50e2b4c2e183727523a80d0.poster.avif?t=1742917644\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/c7ce5647c50e2b4c2e183727523a80d0.apng?t=1742917644\" class=\"bb_img\" width=65 height=64 /></picture></span><br><br>Purify corrupt arcanamals: Help break the corruption that is taking over both worlds.<br><br>No grinding: enemies are in the open world so you can dodge them! They also do not respawn if you defeat them.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/1308bfe89b2bed82e5797b1451f6d0c0.avif?t=1742917644\" data-has-big width=800 height=434 /></span><br><br>Welcome to Arcanamals, a turn-based RPG inspired by classic games like the Legend of Zelda and Breath of Fire. The world is on the brink of destruction. With each nation at war, General Mast, with the help of his shadow army, is taking over the realm of Lanthos.<br><br>Play as Max, Tess, and a cast of over ten characters in this apocalyptic world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/aca426518d81719b1efcae1f76c6bd62.poster.avif?t=1742917644\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/aca426518d81719b1efcae1f76c6bd62.apng?t=1742917644\" class=\"bb_img\" width=65 height=65 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/7ee46d64392a446b5cb75a0605a536e1.poster.avif?t=1742917644\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/7ee46d64392a446b5cb75a0605a536e1.apng?t=1742917644\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span><br><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br>Explore two parallel worlds: one human and one arcanamal.<br><br>Level up in many ways: Gain experience through turn based combat, exploration, quests and much more!<br><br>Unique Abilities: Each arcanamal has unique abilities, such as Phroak with his tongue lash, to solve puzzles!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/c7ce5647c50e2b4c2e183727523a80d0.poster.avif?t=1742917644\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667130/extras/c7ce5647c50e2b4c2e183727523a80d0.apng?t=1742917644\" class=\"bb_img\" width=65 height=64 /></picture></span><br><br>Purify corrupt arcanamals: Help break the corruption that is taking over both worlds.<br><br>No grinding: enemies are in the open world so you can dodge them! They also do not respawn if you defeat them.",
